 ceremony of the forbidden boxes and questions the Original King's decisions.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-12-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kDtzT7d8oWnUaLVZrVsyI3laal2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kDtzT7d8oWnUaLVZrVsyI3laal2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43232/season/2/episode/30"},{"id":"2264013","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":31,"title":{"value":"Episodio 31","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A possessed Wolfram offers to give Shori magical power to protect Yuri but before Shori can answer, an unexpected visitor arrives interrupting the conversation.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-12-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sLDbAK09S23wM4PkiUdD8VhKJgm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sLDbAK09S23wM4PkiUdD8VhKJgm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43232/season/2/episode/31"},{"id":"2264014","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":32,"title":{"value":"Episodio 32","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Shori can now manipulate water and practices. Miko attempts to go to her sons in scuba diving equipment and ends up dragging her husband into freediving. While practicing, Shori loses some control.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-01-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/plp1lhmAH0UJX9FkGUaOVWsuwbz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/plp1lhmAH0UJX9FkGUaOVWsuwbz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43232/season/2/episode/32"},{"id":"2264015","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":33,"title":{"value":"Episodio 33","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yuri forgives Shori for his misdeed and consoles him by telling his admiration for him to use maryoku and recover so quickly.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-01-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8O162Eago1sFkcSJx8zNuWxbBUC.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8O162Eago1sFkcSJx8zNuWxbBUC.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43232/season/2/episode/33"},{"id":"2264016","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":34,"title":{"value":"Episodio 34","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yuri starts the ceremony but Wolfram suddenly attacks Yuri, distracting Yuri into messing up the ceremony. A dark figure appears and takes Conrad's left arm.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-01-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1qx8IPXrn5hs1yflRCJTHfV7OFQ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1qx8IPXrn5hs1yflRCJTHfV7OFQ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43232/season/2/episode/34"},{"id":"2264017","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":35,"title":{"value":"Episodio 35","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Shinou praises his handpicked strategist and Wolfram is taken to Blood Pledge and Greta wonders if he had died. Anissina speculates that Wolfram still is alive and plans to freeze his body like Günter's when he was poisoned.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-01-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vXxEZOjZzMvAKQpoIwdMYMyqx15.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vXxEZOjZzMvAKQpoIwdMYMyqx15.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43232/season/2/episode/35"},{"id":"2264018","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":36,"title":{"value":"Episodio 36","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yuri and co. head back to The Original King's Temple to retrieve the keys from The Original King. However, they are attacked by Soushu's army of dolls when they enter.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-02-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/daC60hmeTvn2vcNH5th51IaqyW7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/daC60hmeTvn2vcNH5th51IaqyW7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43232/season/2/episode/36"},{"id":"2264019","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":37,"title":{"value":"Episodio 37","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Soushu enters Yuri's body to take it over from the inside. Conrad, Gwendal, Jozak, Hube and Günter awaken outside the temple and return to the castle, where Wolfram had been revived with his heartbeat returned to him.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-02-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pOfHVy4i9T5cF2XuZCDwLsA2RIs.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pOfHVy4i9T5cF2XuZCDwLsA2RIs.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43232/season/2/episode/37"},{"id":"2264020","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":38,"title":{"value":"Episodio 38","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Soushu has successfully taken over Yuri's heart by revealing why he chose him as the Maou—to be his body. Meanwhile, Günter and Dorcacos travel to Morgif's birthplace in order for him to reveal his true powers.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-02-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uEhnGpayQn9wtoFKeV5vlrGgTmx.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uEhnGpayQn9wtoFKeV5vlrGgTmx.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43232/season/2/episode/38"},{"id":"2264021","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":39,"title":{"value":"Ep